    18	
    19	"No crosses today," he said. "Nobody's hitting anybody. You're going to stand there, or sit, whatever you like, and try to find me with it. I'm going to make it easy." He did something then that Cael could not see, and did not need to see. "I'm as loud as I go. I'm standing here with the read open all the way and nothing else in my head. If you can't hear me now, you won't hear anybody."
    20	
