   104	
   105	"Well?" said Brom.
   106	
   107	"I had you." Cael's voice came out strange. "Four breaths. You moved and I looked."
   108	
   109	"I know. I felt you go."
   110	
   111	Cael did not answer that, because the headache had arrived.
