    82	
    83	Cael reset and ran the alternation pattern. Speed changes, angle changes, contact high then low then high — feints that had to be answered as strikes, strikes shaped like feints. He was not trying to land anything. He was trying to make the Iron Skin change its mind quickly, over and over, and catch the moment between one mind and the next.
    84	
    85	There was no moment.
